# Lychee ignore list — content-quality gate (D-027).
#
# CI runs `lychee --offline --root-dir apps/web/dist 'apps/web/dist/**/*.html'`,
# so remote URLs are already skipped. These patterns protect the offline pass from
# dev-only/placeholder values that appear in built HTML (config defaults, examples).
http://localhost:*
https://localhost:*
http://127.0.0.1:*
http://0.0.0.0:*
https://example.com/*
https://www.example.com/*
https://api.example.com/*
https://staging-api.example.com/*
mailto:*
